  /// Kilograms the character pushes dynamic bodies with (`0` pushes nothing).
  final double mass;
  /// Walk speed of the runtime driver (`move_action`), m/s.
  final double speed;
  /// Take-off speed of a `jump` without an explicit speed, m/s.
  final double jumpSpeed;
  /// Radians per second the entity turns towards its horizontal motion (`0` leaves the rotation to gameplay).
  final double turnSpeed;
  /// A 2D action walked by the runtime every tick at `speed` (x right, y forward, relative to the camera that targets this entity); empty leaves movement to `move` commands.
  final String moveAction;
  /// A button action whose press jumps when grounded; empty leaves it to `jump` commands.
  final String jumpAction;
  /// Which layers the capsule collides with and walks on (bit `i` = the project's `layers[i]`); its own layer is its entity's `fynkel.Layer` (ADR-0020).
